  "translation": "Ndipo Uriya anati kwa Davide: “Ngati chikhulupiriro ⟨את⟩ Aroni ndi Yisraeli ndi Yuda akhala m'mahema, ndipo mbuye wanga Yoabu ndi akapolo a mbuye wanga ali poyamba pa kutchire, akhazikika; ndipo ine ndidzalowa m'nyumba yanga kudya ndi kumwa ndi kugona ndi mkazi wanga? Monga moyo wako uli, ndi moyo wa moyo wako, sindidzachita ⟨את⟩ chinthu ichi.”",
